From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ps5cemu <ps5cemu@localhost>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:29:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] PS5: Eye Aim Assist is five steps, its arrow cone is 30
 degrees, and the hand's Magnesis pushes, pulls and turns overhead objects
 without a clamp; built, untested on console

The hand path's push and pull offset is clamped against the hand's own distance every frame, so a full pull followed by the hand coming in or tilting up keeps the object in front at the pull's floor instead of letting the distance go negative and turn it around.
